=== Step 1/8: Before you start ===
[GUIDE] This guide sets up every servo, then fits the head and the four legs.
[GUIDE]   - Body as in the RatBot STL files: batteries facing DOWN, toward the belly.
[GUIDE]   - Directions are the robot's own. NOSE is the head end. LEFT and RIGHT are as seen from behind, with the head pointing away from you.
[GUIDE]   - _N parts go on the left, _P parts on the right.
[GUIDE]   - No cranks or leg parts on any servo yet. Support the robot so every horn turns freely.
[GUIDE]   - Battery on, robot USB connected, no other serial monitor open.
[GUIDE]   - Answer q at any question to stop; the servos are released.
[GUIDE] Press Enter when ready.
