=== Step 2/8: Servo setup ===
[GUIDE] First every servo gets the settings for its ID. Then you turn each horn by hand once, so the guide learns which servo sits where. Reused servos keep the ID of the place they had before; with the body turned over that is often another place. Those are renumbered over the bus: nothing needs unplugging.
